><a href={PAYMENT_LINK}><span style=color:#000000>Payment Link</span></a></strong></span></span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Regards</div><div>{COMPANY_NAME}</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Invoice generated via&nbsp;<a href=https://test.giddh.com>test.giddh.com</a></div></div></body></html>",
